Simulate with a stack: for each number, apply the pending operation. Multiply/divide operate on the stack top (floor division on positive operands is just intdiv), addition pushes the number, subtraction pushes its negation. Sum the stack at the end.

```php
class Solution {

    /**
     * @param Integer $n
     * @return Integer
     */
    function clumsy($n) {
        $stack = [$n];
        $op = 0; // 0: *, 1: /, 2: +, 3: -
        for ($i = $n - 1; $i >= 1; $i--) {
            switch ($op) {
                case 0:
                    $top = array_pop($stack);
                    $stack[] = $top * $i;
                    break;
                case 1:
                    $top = array_pop($stack);
                    $stack[] = intdiv($top, $i);
                    break;
                case 2:
                    $stack[] = $i;
                    break;
                case 3:
                    $stack[] = -$i;
                    break;
            }
            $op = ($op + 1) % 4;
        }
        return array_sum($stack);
    }
}
```

